Source: easpanel
Section: audio
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Fred Gleason <fredg@paravelsystems.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 12), autotools-dev
Standards-Version: 4.4.1

Package: easpanel
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Emergency Management Control Applet for DASDAQ/Rivendell
 EASPanel is a control applet for sending Emergency Alert System (EAS)
 alerts generated by a DASDAQ EAS generator to Rivendell.

Package: easpanel-belt
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Conveyor belt service for distributing files
 This package provides the easbelt(8) service, which can be used to
 automate the distribution of files in a one-to-many fashion.

Package: easpanel-pypad
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, rivendell
Description: Rivendell PyPAD Script for EASPanel
 This package provides a Rivendell PyPAD Script for EASPanel.
